Subject: [PATCH 16/68] ipa: rkisp1: Move AGC related controls into AGC
 algorithm
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Move the `ControlInfo` setup and related initialization into the AGC
algorithm instead of having it in the main IPA file.

Signed-off-by: Barnabás Pőcze <barnabas.pocze@ideasonboard.com>
Reviewed-by: Kieran Bingham <kieran.bingham@ideasonboard.com>
Reviewed-by: Jacopo Mondi <jacopo.mondi@ideasonboard.com>
(cherry picked from commit 1f1f5b4af8f44bea3e5494218fae193fae2ff578)
---
 src/ipa/rkisp1/algorithms/agc.cpp | 92 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/ipa/rkisp1/rkisp1.cpp         | 92 +------------------------------
 2 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 92 deletions(-)

